{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1153754-c20-rules-for-epiphany","id":1153754,"title":"C20 rules for Epiphany","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-28T09:28:12-07:00","id":1153754,"title":"C20 rules for Epiphany","content":"OK, so I want to make sure I understand the rules as written in C20 correctly.<br /> <br /> Reverie, Ravaging and Rhapsody can only be performed on Dreamers, and a Dreamer is someone who has a Banality rating no higher than 3. Is this correct? I'm still a bit unsure after reading over the relevant parts of the book a few times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-28T14:44:59-07:00","id":1153804,"title":"","content":"Actually looking over the Epiphany rules...there's nothing that says that it HAS to be performed on Dreamers.<br /> <br /> In fact, the Rhapsody rules even state that it's possible to perform that on someone who isn't particularly talented or skilled in the arts, but that it's not as ideal versus using it on someone who's actually a Dreamer.<br /> <br /> ...although now that you point it out, it looks like there isn't any mechanical benefits listed for doing the three mentioned Epiphanies on a Dreamer. More specifically, a target's Banality rating doesn't seem to factor into Epiphany. At least none that I can find. Which is weird...because otherwise the system doesn't match up story-wise on how important Dreamers are to changelings if they seemingly can do Epiphany on any old mortal without any drawbacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}